1
00:00:51,460 --> 00:00:52,460
=As Promised=

2
00:00:52,460 --> 00:00:54,060
(Adapted from "The Villain's Guide to Love",
a story on Zhihu Yanyan)

3
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:56,900
=Episode 7=

4
00:00:59,150 --> 00:01:00,070
Xiaoyuan.

5
00:01:00,070 --> 00:01:01,300
("Tea" Arts Manual)

6
00:01:01,520 --> 00:01:02,710
You had such a good book,

7
00:01:02,710 --> 00:01:03,960
so why didn't you share it sooner?

8
00:01:04,590 --> 00:01:05,200
Tell me.

9
00:01:05,920 --> 00:01:07,000
Do the tricks in this book

10
00:01:07,280 --> 00:01:08,000
actually work?

11
00:01:10,430 --> 00:01:11,200
I...

12
00:01:17,070 --> 00:01:17,480
Xiaoyuan.

13
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:19,000
I can't let this chance slip away.

14
00:01:19,250 --> 00:01:20,610
I'm going to put
what I just learned into practice.

15
00:01:24,560 --> 00:01:25,310
Good luck.

16
00:01:32,430 --> 00:01:33,640
Just watch me.

17
00:01:36,590 --> 00:01:37,230
A snake!

18
00:01:37,430 --> 00:01:38,200
There's a snake!

19
00:01:38,790 --> 00:01:39,310
Your Highness!

20
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:41,790
Fu Yang.

21
00:01:42,280 --> 00:01:43,310
Save me.

22
00:01:43,760 --> 00:01:44,230
Your Highness.

23
00:01:44,400 --> 00:01:45,200
Where are you hurt?

24
00:01:52,590 --> 00:01:54,280
On my calf.

25
00:01:54,480 --> 00:01:56,840
It's bleeding so much.

26
00:01:58,150 --> 00:01:58,870
Fu Yang.

27
00:01:58,870 --> 00:01:59,920
Quick, take a look.

28
00:02:00,150 --> 00:02:02,280
Am I going to die?

29
00:02:06,680 --> 00:02:08,000
(You lifted the hem of my skirt)

30
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:09,000
(and saw my ankle.)

31
00:02:09,140 --> 00:02:10,570
(Let's see how you can
avoid taking responsibility now.)

32
00:02:25,870 --> 00:02:27,120
I'm afraid
you're mistaken, Your Highness.

33
00:02:27,470 --> 00:02:29,120
Snake repellent
has already been scattered here.

34
00:02:29,150 --> 00:02:30,520
Snakes wouldn't come near this place.

35
00:02:31,150 --> 00:02:32,030
You were probably

36
00:02:32,030 --> 00:02:33,560
bitten by a centipede
or some other insect.

37
00:02:33,910 --> 00:02:34,560
But...

38
00:02:34,710 --> 00:02:35,360
But I...

39
00:02:35,470 --> 00:02:36,420
It would be improper
for me to examine you.

40
00:02:36,590 --> 00:02:38,000
I'll go get a nanny right away.

41
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:43,000
Fu Yang, you blockhead!

42
00:02:45,030 --> 00:02:47,120
This doesn't work either!

43
00:02:50,870 --> 00:02:52,150
That's strange.

44
00:02:53,240 --> 00:02:55,870
(Zhao Boqing
clearly said it would work.)

45
00:02:56,020 --> 00:02:58,100
(Qingyan Palace)

46
00:03:01,840 --> 00:03:03,280
You asked me to play chess
with you late at night.

47
00:03:04,120 --> 00:03:05,280
I assume you have something to tell me.

48
00:03:06,430 --> 00:03:07,360
Your Highness.

49
00:03:07,630 --> 00:03:09,870
I have observed
a change in the celestial signs

50
00:03:09,870 --> 00:03:10,800
and came especially to warn you.

51
00:03:12,310 --> 00:03:14,080
The Pleiades and its
companion star are drawing closer,

52
00:03:14,080 --> 00:03:15,080
giving rise to an unusual power.

53
00:03:15,400 --> 00:03:16,590
Forgive me for speaking frankly.

54
00:03:17,710 --> 00:03:19,080
Your Highness's most pressing task

55
00:03:19,080 --> 00:03:20,240
is to guide the Crown Prince

56
00:03:20,240 --> 00:03:21,910
into falling deeply
in love with He Xiaoyuan,

57
00:03:22,280 --> 00:03:23,030
rather than

58
00:03:23,750 --> 00:03:25,400
constantly staying by her side

59
00:03:25,910 --> 00:03:26,910
and needlessly increasing the risk.

60
00:03:34,680 --> 00:03:35,590
Your Highness.

61
00:03:51,240 --> 00:03:52,030
She's

62
00:03:52,870 --> 00:03:53,840
naturally slow-witted.

63
00:03:54,630 --> 00:03:55,870
That's why I have no choice

64
00:03:56,240 --> 00:03:57,150
but to teach her myself.

65
00:04:00,630 --> 00:04:02,080
Your Highness is a wise man.

66
00:04:02,470 --> 00:04:04,000
You should know that
if the stars stray from their course

67
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:05,190
and are not corrected in time,

68
00:04:05,470 --> 00:04:06,680
growing too close

69
00:04:06,960 --> 00:04:08,120
may lead to disaster.

70
00:04:08,910 --> 00:04:09,840
When that happens,

71
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:11,400
your fortunes will become intertwined,

72
00:04:11,630 --> 00:04:13,120
and harm will be inevitable.

73
00:04:14,800 --> 00:04:15,910
As for Miss He,

74
00:04:16,800 --> 00:04:18,480
her fate is the weaker of the two.

75
00:04:19,360 --> 00:04:20,270
I'm afraid...

76
00:04:22,950 --> 00:04:24,040
Afraid of what?

77
00:04:25,430 --> 00:04:26,600
Her life

78
00:04:27,720 --> 00:04:28,920
is in imminent danger.

79
00:05:00,680 --> 00:05:01,240
He Xiaoyuan.

80
00:05:01,830 --> 00:05:03,120
Can you keep it down at night?

81
00:05:03,600 --> 00:05:04,750
Even Mrs. Zhuang next door

82
00:05:04,850 --> 00:05:06,050
sounds better fluffing cotton
than you do playing.

83
00:05:06,720 --> 00:05:07,800
If you keep playing at night,

84
00:05:08,090 --> 00:05:09,190
I'll report you
for disturbing the neighbors.

85
00:05:16,270 --> 00:05:18,120
Why can't I get it right?

86
00:05:20,680 --> 00:05:22,830
Zhao Boqing used to teach me.

87
00:05:24,240 --> 00:05:27,160
If only he could guide my hands
while teaching me the zither.

88
00:05:39,390 --> 00:05:40,680
What musician

89
00:05:40,680 --> 00:05:42,160
would be playing
the zither this late at night?

90
00:05:42,750 --> 00:05:44,360
And it's the very piece I'm learning.

91
00:05:51,830 --> 00:05:53,480
(I knew this fool hadn't learned it.)

92
00:05:54,560 --> 00:05:56,160
(Sure enough, she can't even
play the prelude properly.)

93
00:05:57,510 --> 00:05:58,390
(He Xiaoyuan.)

94
00:05:59,870 --> 00:06:01,630
(Since I can no longer
keep you at Qingyan Palace)

95
00:06:01,630 --> 00:06:02,920
(and stay close to you day and night,)

96
00:06:03,920 --> 00:06:04,510
(I)

97
00:06:05,390 --> 00:06:06,680
(can only teach you this way.)

98
00:06:26,190 --> 00:06:28,240
What beautiful music and scenery.

99
00:06:30,240 --> 00:06:32,680
I wonder which charming young gentleman

100
00:06:32,800 --> 00:06:35,480
is playing such a lovesick
"The Phoenix Seeks His Mate."

101
00:06:42,950 --> 00:06:45,390
Through the dewy night,
the young gentleman stands,

102
00:06:46,190 --> 00:06:48,800
his fingers plucking
icy strings to tell of his love.

103
00:06:51,160 --> 00:06:52,480
Even heaven and earth

104
00:06:52,480 --> 00:06:53,480
must someday come to an end...

105
00:06:58,800 --> 00:07:00,560
If you can't write poetry, then don't.

106
00:07:01,560 --> 00:07:02,040
Get lost.

107
00:07:08,720 --> 00:07:09,750
"The Phoenix Seeks His Mate"?

108
00:07:10,270 --> 00:07:12,000
I was clearly playing "Yangzhou Adagio."

109
00:07:17,270 --> 00:07:18,070
Your Highness.

110
00:07:20,360 --> 00:07:22,360
It's late, and the night air is cold.

111
00:07:22,430 --> 00:07:23,870
Aren't you cold playing the zither

112
00:07:24,390 --> 00:07:25,070
out here?

113
00:07:28,390 --> 00:07:29,750
You've only been out
of the palace for half a day,

114
00:07:30,040 --> 00:07:30,800
and your zither playing

115
00:07:31,190 --> 00:07:32,920
is already back to its old ways.

116
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:33,680
How could I

117
00:07:33,870 --> 00:07:35,040
not keep a closer eye on you?

118
00:07:35,240 --> 00:07:37,950
I knew Your Highness
was practicing the piece for me.

119
00:07:38,630 --> 00:07:39,270
Your Highness.

120
00:07:39,630 --> 00:07:40,920
You're so kind to me.

121
00:07:42,630 --> 00:07:43,000
So,

122
00:07:43,270 --> 00:07:44,720
I brought you a cloak.

123
00:07:45,160 --> 00:07:45,950
How thoughtful of you.

124
00:07:48,240 --> 00:07:48,750
Here.

125
00:08:12,720 --> 00:08:13,480
Are you all right?

126
00:08:16,120 --> 00:08:17,510
There's another note here.

127
00:08:17,630 --> 00:08:18,430
(Special Note)

128
00:08:18,630 --> 00:08:20,000
(The key to this trick)

129
00:08:20,070 --> 00:08:21,560
(is that the other person
has feelings for you.)

130
00:08:21,630 --> 00:08:22,270
(If not,)

131
00:08:22,380 --> 00:08:23,970
(you'll only make a fool
of yourself by imitating others.)

132
00:08:24,720 --> 00:08:25,510
(So...)

133
00:08:26,270 --> 00:08:27,600
(Zhao Boqing has feelings for me.)

134
00:08:30,510 --> 00:08:32,030
I'm... I'm fine.

135
00:08:46,720 --> 00:08:47,840
This is...

136
00:09:01,080 --> 00:09:01,910
Zhao Boqing.

137
00:09:02,550 --> 00:09:03,480
You are...

138
00:09:06,240 --> 00:09:06,600
Your Highness!

139
00:09:07,120 --> 00:09:07,790
Something's happened.

140
00:09:08,290 --> 00:09:09,340
His Majesty has summoned you urgently.

141
00:09:22,440 --> 00:09:23,840
Of the 30,000 suits
of armor for the border troops,

142
00:09:24,910 --> 00:09:26,750
you dared falsely report 20,000.

143
00:09:26,910 --> 00:09:28,030
The military funds you embezzled

144
00:09:28,030 --> 00:09:30,030
have simply vanished without a trace

145
00:09:30,030 --> 00:09:31,600
into your private coffers.

146
00:09:33,600 --> 00:09:34,320
You unfilial son!

147
00:09:34,720 --> 00:09:36,080
What are you trying to do?

148
00:09:38,270 --> 00:09:38,840
Father,

149
00:09:39,360 --> 00:09:40,910
I have never done such a thing.

150
00:09:41,360 --> 00:09:42,360
Please calm down, Father.

151
00:09:43,670 --> 00:09:44,600
The evidence is conclusive,

152
00:09:44,910 --> 00:09:46,150
yet you still dare deny it?

153
00:09:46,550 --> 00:09:47,120
Guards!

154
00:09:48,600 --> 00:09:49,270
Effective immediately,

155
00:09:49,630 --> 00:09:51,600
confine the Seventh Prince
to Qingyan Palace.

156
00:09:51,750 --> 00:09:52,840
He is not permitted to leave.

157
00:09:53,000 --> 00:09:54,000
As for his trusted men,

158
00:09:54,000 --> 00:09:55,080
throw them all in prison

159
00:09:55,080 --> 00:09:56,270
and interrogate them under torture.

160
00:09:56,550 --> 00:09:57,440
Crown Prince,

161
00:09:58,510 --> 00:10:00,080
you will take full charge
of this investigation.

162
00:10:00,270 --> 00:10:01,270
You must give me

163
00:10:01,510 --> 00:10:02,670
a full account of this matter.

164
00:10:06,080 --> 00:10:06,910
I accept your command.

165
00:10:07,910 --> 00:10:09,360
(What on earth is going on?)

166
00:10:30,080 --> 00:10:31,510
Fu Yang, come with me.

167
00:10:34,440 --> 00:10:35,360
I can't leave.

168
00:10:36,600 --> 00:10:37,670
What are you afraid of?

169
00:10:37,840 --> 00:10:39,000
I'll take responsibility
if anything happens.

170
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:40,200
Just say I broke you out of prison.

171
00:10:40,790 --> 00:10:41,600
Your Highness,

172
00:10:42,860 --> 00:10:44,180
you have no clan to
be punished along with you.

173
00:10:46,150 --> 00:10:49,350
♪The flames of war rise again, in this
long age of chaos, there is no Chang'an♪

174
00:10:49,390 --> 00:10:50,240
But I do.

175
00:10:53,720 --> 00:10:59,450
♪The sword gleams cold, the young
nobleman is nowhere to be seen♪

176
00:11:00,360 --> 00:11:03,770
♪Mounting his warhorse,
his figure slowly fades♪

177
00:11:04,310 --> 00:11:07,370
♪Like an old friend
disappearing into the distance♪

178
00:11:07,380 --> 00:11:08,150
Your Highness.

179
00:11:08,440 --> 00:11:09,480
What are you doing?

180
00:11:10,150 --> 00:11:11,200
At this point,

181
00:11:11,480 --> 00:11:13,480
our only option is to make things
irreversible between us.

182
00:11:13,750 --> 00:11:14,960
Becoming my Prince Consort

183
00:11:14,960 --> 00:11:15,670
is your only way out.

184
00:11:18,550 --> 00:11:19,360
Fu Yang.

185
00:11:20,630 --> 00:11:21,440
Your Highness.

186
00:11:22,030 --> 00:11:23,550
You don't have to go this far.

187
00:11:24,000 --> 00:11:24,370
You...

188
00:11:24,630 --> 00:11:25,240
Put it on.

189
00:11:27,670 --> 00:11:28,840
Then I'll take it off.

190
00:11:30,840 --> 00:11:31,440
Fu Yang.

191
00:11:31,790 --> 00:11:33,150
Are you a monk?

192
00:11:33,270 --> 00:11:34,750
I've gone this far,

193
00:11:34,840 --> 00:11:36,480
and you still
don't understand how I feel?

194
00:11:37,360 --> 00:11:39,240
I refuse to believe
you feel nothing for me.

195
00:11:40,030 --> 00:11:41,750
Open your eyes and look at me.

196
00:11:41,960 --> 00:11:43,150
Look at me.

197
00:11:43,550 --> 00:11:44,360
Your Highness.

198
00:11:45,750 --> 00:11:46,550
Stop this.

199
00:11:48,840 --> 00:11:49,630
I promise you

200
00:11:50,840 --> 00:11:52,390
I'll get out of here safe and sound.

201
00:11:53,670 --> 00:11:54,390
All right?

202
00:11:57,480 --> 00:11:58,600
Safe and sound?

203
00:12:01,000 --> 00:12:02,270
What makes you so sure?

204
00:12:07,200 --> 00:12:08,000
Your Highness.

205
00:12:10,080 --> 00:12:11,030
Please trust me.

206
00:12:31,630 --> 00:12:32,240
He Xiaoyuan.

207
00:12:32,650 --> 00:12:34,080
You disguised yourself as a maid
from the Imperial Kitchen to come here.

208
00:12:34,080 --> 00:12:34,790
Do you have a death wish?

209
00:12:35,240 --> 00:12:36,840
But I was worried about you.

210
00:12:42,510 --> 00:12:43,120
You...

211
00:12:43,720 --> 00:12:44,910
(Growing too close)

212
00:12:45,200 --> 00:12:46,600
(may lead to disaster.)

213
00:12:48,670 --> 00:12:50,480
(I only couldn't resist
getting a little closer to her,)

214
00:12:51,150 --> 00:12:52,600
(and this happened.)

215
00:12:55,080 --> 00:12:56,600
Your task is to win
over the Crown Prince.

216
00:12:57,200 --> 00:12:58,030
My affairs

217
00:12:59,360 --> 00:13:00,080
are none of your concern.

218
00:13:00,360 --> 00:13:02,240
How can you say that?

219
00:13:03,150 --> 00:13:03,510
Well,

220
00:13:03,790 --> 00:13:05,670
we're allies, at least.

221
00:13:07,000 --> 00:13:07,630
He Xiaoyuan.

222
00:13:08,480 --> 00:13:11,000
In my eyes, you're
nothing more than a pawn.

223
00:13:14,080 --> 00:13:14,910
Don't read too much into it.

224
00:13:22,270 --> 00:13:24,080
A pawn it is, then.

225
00:13:28,000 --> 00:13:28,790
Zhao Boqing.

226
00:13:29,600 --> 00:13:31,200
In the previous thirty-three lifetimes,

227
00:13:31,360 --> 00:13:32,750
did I pay too little attention to you,

228
00:13:32,750 --> 00:13:33,600
or was there some other reason?

229
00:13:33,840 --> 00:13:35,000
I don't remember

230
00:13:35,000 --> 00:13:36,670
anything about you
being sentenced to beheading.

231
00:13:37,240 --> 00:13:38,080
Outside Wu Gate,

232
00:13:38,080 --> 00:13:39,600
they're even building
a tiger-head executioner.

233
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:40,550
The Princess

234
00:13:41,030 --> 00:13:42,320
is also planning
to break him out of prison

235
00:13:42,480 --> 00:13:43,790
and elope with Fu Yang.

236
00:13:44,550 --> 00:13:45,390
Tell me.

237
00:13:45,790 --> 00:13:47,600
What if Fu Yang
can't withstand the torture

238
00:13:47,750 --> 00:13:48,840
and confesses to something he didn't do?

239
00:13:48,960 --> 00:13:49,200
Then...

240
00:13:49,200 --> 00:13:50,240
You don't need to worry about Fu Yang.

241
00:13:50,750 --> 00:13:52,360
He has never betrayed me
in the previous thirty-three lifetimes.

242
00:13:52,840 --> 00:13:53,910
And he knows

243
00:13:54,630 --> 00:13:55,550
all my secrets.

244
00:13:56,320 --> 00:13:57,630
Even the matter of the stars' course...

245
00:14:02,030 --> 00:14:02,670
Then,

246
00:14:02,870 --> 00:14:04,390
in the previous lifetimes,

247
00:14:04,840 --> 00:14:06,750
how did you resolve this?

248
00:14:08,000 --> 00:14:10,480
This never happened
in the previous thirty-three lifetimes.

249
00:14:10,960 --> 00:14:12,480
There's nothing wrong with your memory.

250
00:14:13,240 --> 00:14:14,360
The current situation

251
00:14:14,840 --> 00:14:16,030
is a new turn of events

252
00:14:16,720 --> 00:14:17,750
caused by the two of us joining forces.

253
00:14:21,270 --> 00:14:21,910
I see.

254
00:14:22,440 --> 00:14:23,550
I'll think of something.

255
00:14:25,390 --> 00:14:26,050
It's already so late,

256
00:14:26,050 --> 00:14:27,010
and the palace gates are locked.

257
00:14:27,320 --> 00:14:28,000
Where are you going?

258
00:14:29,750 --> 00:14:30,550
I forgot.

259
00:14:42,200 --> 00:14:43,360
Your Highness, don't worry.

260
00:14:43,480 --> 00:14:44,910
I'm very well behaved when I sleep.

261
00:14:44,910 --> 00:14:46,750
I definitely won't snore
or talk in my sleep.

262
00:14:49,790 --> 00:14:51,360
Thank you for letting me stay.

263
00:14:52,000 --> 00:14:52,960
Tomorrow,

264
00:14:52,960 --> 00:14:54,510
once the curfew
at the outer palace is lifted,

265
00:14:54,510 --> 00:14:55,600
I'll sneak away.

266
00:14:55,600 --> 00:14:56,670
No one will notice.

267
00:14:58,960 --> 00:14:59,960
You'd better make sure of that.

268
00:15:30,020 --> 00:15:32,100
(Qingyan Palace)

269
00:15:59,390 --> 00:16:01,630
(Qingyan Palace)
He Xiaoyuan!

270
00:16:14,080 --> 00:16:15,270
(What's going on?)

271
00:16:15,480 --> 00:16:17,510
(How did I end up in Zhao Boqing's bed?)

272
00:16:18,060 --> 00:16:20,060
(Last Night)

273
00:16:26,000 --> 00:16:27,200
Cold...

274
00:16:33,790 --> 00:16:36,030
How did the blanket get over there?

275
00:17:14,400 --> 00:17:15,200
Your Highness.

276
00:17:15,750 --> 00:17:17,070
If I said

277
00:17:18,000 --> 00:17:18,790
this was an accident,

278
00:17:19,440 --> 00:17:20,480
would you believe me?

279
00:17:21,750 --> 00:17:22,960
I would.

280
00:17:23,110 --> 00:17:25,160
As if I'd believe that! Get off!

281
00:17:26,200 --> 00:17:27,110
I won't.

282
00:17:28,350 --> 00:17:29,160
Get off!

283
00:17:29,640 --> 00:17:30,830
- Get off!
- Your Highness.

284
00:17:32,510 --> 00:17:35,400
- I won't.
- Get... get off!

285
00:17:35,590 --> 00:17:37,400
Actually, it wasn't
entirely an accident.

286
00:17:43,590 --> 00:17:44,750
Your Highness.

287
00:17:48,590 --> 00:17:50,480
I like you.

288
00:17:58,620 --> 00:18:00,940
♪My longing has nowhere to rest♪

289
00:18:01,300 --> 00:18:02,980
♪Through the storm, I drift and sway♪

290
00:18:03,620 --> 00:18:06,620
♪You are the prayer I hold in my palm♪

291
00:18:07,140 --> 00:18:11,460
♪In one frozen moment,
my tears come into focus♪

292
00:18:11,460 --> 00:18:14,220
♪My heart has long known♪

293
00:18:14,660 --> 00:18:16,660
♪We made a promise long ago♪

294
00:18:16,980 --> 00:18:18,580
♪To stay together until the end of time♪

295
00:18:19,260 --> 00:18:22,580
♪You are the fate I cannot escape♪

296
00:18:22,900 --> 00:18:25,740
♪How much must I let go♪

297
00:18:26,060 --> 00:18:27,740
♪For one moment♪

298
00:18:28,020 --> 00:18:30,740
♪To hold each other close♪

299
00:18:30,980 --> 00:18:35,300
♪Would that be enough?♪
